# THE PAIR: THE SAME EMPTY LIST, AND THIS ONE MAY SAY "NONE".
#
# No clusters, `scan_complete: true`. The pass walked the library and found
# nothing to merge, so "No duplicates" is now a sentence the vault has earned.
# Byte-for-byte this fixture differs from `photos-duplicates/scan-incomplete` in
# one boolean, and that boolean is the difference between a finished answer and
# a progress report. A screen that only checked `clusters.isEmpty()` draws both
# the same and is wrong about one of them.
#
# Asserting them together rather than separately is deliberate: two independent
# assertions pass just as happily against a decoder that collapsed the two.
seat {
  availability: AVAILABILITY_READY
  durability: DURABILITY_AUTHORITATIVE
  connectivity: CONNECTIVITY_ONLINE_UNMETERED
}
data {
  scan_complete: true
}
